                    <chunk name="param_input" index="8">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Where the ground comes from. GEDTM30: global bare-earth model, 30 m (CC BY 4.0) - the default. Auto: the regional bare-earth model that covers the site (Canada HRDEM, else USGS 3DEP), else GEDTM30. USGS 3DEP: the 1 m lidar DEM where a project covers the site, else ~10 m, then ~30 m, USA (public domain). Canada HRDEM: lidar DTM at 1 m, then 2 m, where flown, Canada (Open Government Licence - Canada). Copernicus GLO-30: global but a SURFACE model - buildings and trees are in the heights, so building massing seated on it stands too high (use only where nothing else covers the site). Each is read straight from its public bucket, no key. A source with no data at the site gives flat ground and says so in the Report. Optional; default GEDTM30.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">27ba28b7-cd56-494d-9ff9-87b86608cee4</item>
                        <item name="Multiple" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Terrain Source</item>
                        <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Terrain Source</item>
                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Options" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">GEDTM30
Auto (best bare-earth)
USGS 3DEP
Canada HRDEM
Austria ALS DTM
Bavaria DGM1
North Rhine-Westphalia DGM1
Rhineland-Palatinate DGM1
Hesse DGM1
Brandenburg DGM1
Lower Saxony DGM1
Emilia-Romagna coast DTM
South Tyrol DTM
Luxembourg LiDAR DTM
Netherlands AHN DTM
swissALTI3D
France IGN (LiDAR HD + RGE ALTI)
Scotland LiDAR DTM
Wales LiDAR DTM
England LiDAR composite DTM
Poland NMT
Czechia DMR 5G
Norway DTM1
Estonia DTM 5 m
Tasmania 2 m DEM
Copernicus GLO-30 (surface model)
GEM-15 terrain model</item>
                        <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="Value" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">GEDTM30</item>
