                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">One closed mesh per building, seated on the terrain (roof = median ground + height; the base reaches 20 m below the lowest ground under it so it pierces the terrain, or stands on z = 0 without terrain). Each mesh carries its height, height kind and source id (OSM or Overture) as user strings. Plug into the wind case's Buildings.</item>
