                    <chunk name="param_input" index="8">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Distance to lift each point off its surface before tracing. Analysis grids usually sit ON geometry that also shades, and without this every point shadows itself. The default 0.2 m also clears a kerb foot or an unwelded terrain seam, where a mesh vertex lifted a centimetre reads 0 hours beside neighbours in full sun.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f519d6a0-2ce2-43a4-b885-7ca39f28654d</item>
